7.657">心</span></p><p begin="1:47.667" end="1:48.649" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.667" end="1:48.116">别人会</span><span begin="1:48.116" end="1:48.547">看不见</span><span begin="1:48.547" end="1:48.649">你</span></p><p begin="1:48.659" end="1:50.469" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:48.659" end="1:49.023">到最</span><span begin="1:49.023" end="1:49.232">后</span><span begin="1:49.232" end="1:49.792">只是一个</span><span begin="1:49.792" end="1:50.097">接一个的</span><span begin="1:50.097" end="1:50.469">分身</span></p><p begin="1:50.479" end="1:52.646" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.479" end="1:51.102">这样的鼓</span><span begin="1:51.102" end="1:51.355">励</span> <span begin="1:51.355" end="1:51.907">是否太直</span><span begin="1:51.907" end="1:52.155">接</span> <span begin="1:52.155" end="1:52.502">太讽</span><span begin="1:52.502" end="1:52.646">刺</span></p><p begin="1:52.712" end="1:54.398" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.712" end="1:53.152">老师在</span><span begin="1:53.152" end="1:53.433">讲</span> <span begin="1:53.433" end="1:53.724">到底</span><span begin="1:53.724" end="1:54.000">有没有在</span><span begin="1:54.000" end="1:54.398">听啊</span></p><p begin="1:54.408" end="1:56.503" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.408" end="1:54.852">我告诉</span><span begin="1:54.852" end="1:55.120">你</span> <span begin="1:55.120" end="1:55.400">做自</span><span begin="1:55.400" end="1:55.669">己</span><span begin="1:55.669" end="1:56.218">胜于跟太</span><span begin="1:56.218" end="1:56.503">紧</span></p><p begin="1:56.513" end="1:58.818" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.513" end="1:57.109">最大的敌</span><span begin="1:57.109" end="1:57.353">人</span><span begin="1:57.353" end="1:57.505">就</span><span begin="1:57.505" end="1:57.785">是</span><span begin="1:57.785" end="1:58.077">那内</span><span begin="1:58.077" end="1:58.322">心</span><span begin="1:58.322" end="1:58.603">的自</span><span begin="1:58.603" end="1:58.818">己</span>